    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the flap track carriage installation, covering the roller assembly, the seal retainer, the track drain filter and the heat exchanger mounting that sets the drain slope.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of one flap track carriage, from the carriage body outward to the roller assembly, the seal retainer and the track drain path.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows one inboard carriage; all carriages on both wings use the same breakdown and the position is given by the carriage number in the illustration. The drain filter at item 30 is available in two mesh grades; the coarser grade is the current standard and the finer one is supported for spares only. The heat exchanger mounting shim stack is not itemised and is ordered as a set."
    },
